{
  "song_id":10953225,
  "title":"Sinode Pibouin (Insurrection-Non-Violente)",
  "language":"fr",
  "lyricists":[
    55334
  ],
  "lyrics":[
    {
      "section_id":"section_0",
      "type":"intro",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Sinode Pibouin",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Sinode Pibouin",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Sinode Pibouin",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Si...",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"- \"C'est toujours la religion du Stup, ils ont pas évolués du tout, c'est encore la même chose, mais moi j'en ai marre !\"",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"- \"Joël ? Approche-toi\"",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"- \"Oh !\"",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"- \"Viens par ici\"",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"- \"Oui ?\"",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"- \"Mais croyais-tu sincèrement que la religion du Stup pouvait s'éteindre ?\"",
          "rhyme":")dR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"- \"Mais non maître, jamais je n'ai eu de telles pensées !\"",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AAABCDEBBFG",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AAABCCDBBAE"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"couplet",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Ils ont choisi la peur pour manipuler nos gens",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Ils sont décomplexés, calculateurs et diligents",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Leur arrogance luit telle un astre malsain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Ils tracent leur chеmin sans se soucier du bien commun",
          "rhyme":"(",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Lеs cocmocréas sont tous en passe de réussir",
          "rhyme":"iR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Nous les châtierons mais il est trop tôt pour se réjouir",
          "rhyme":"iR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Unissons nos forces dans un ultime effort",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Bâillonnons les hyènes qui prônent la loi du plus fort",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"kingju"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABCDDEE",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABCDDEE"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"refrain",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
